<title>UK: Brazil's Globo plans $100 mln Eurobond -bankers.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Globo plans $100 mln Eurobond -bankers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian media and cable television group Globo plans to issue a $100 million Eurobond, bankers said on Monday.</p>
<p>The bond is likely to have a three-year maturity, they said. Chase was tipped as lead manager.</p>
<p>Emerging market debt traders said the deal was unlikely to surface before September.</p>
<p>-- Aline van Duyn, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
